<title>JAPAN: Kraft Inc - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Kraft Inc - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  8.58		vs	    7.72</p>
<p> Operating   loss 185 million	 vs	prft 244 million</p>
